00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.440
The main story first, then a few quick hits.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.760
First story, and it's an update on one we've been following,

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.500
Jensen Huang's resignation as NVIDIA CEO after a board probe.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.000
This is still reported, not confirmed.

